with currentContractTotal = contractValue + approvedVariations (portalV2Routes.mjs:1217). But the canonical job_variations.status is deliberately NOT flipped to 'signed' on client approval (portalV2Routes.mjs:507-511 — 'we do NOT flip the canonical job_variations record to signed here'). Meanwhile the Finance command-centre counts the SAME variation as unsigned: financeCCRoutes.mjs:468-469 `if (v.status === "signed") b.signedVar += ...; else if (["draft","sent_to_client"].includes(v.status)) b.unsignedVar += ...;` (status is still 'sent_to_client' after client approval, so it lands in unsignedVar). And the legacy portal budget counts it as pending too: portalRoutes.mjs:1020-1025 `approved = filter(status==="signed")`, `pending = filter(status==="sent_to_client")`.
